      "status": "expressed",
      "check_id": "scheduled-posts",
      "method": "The check requires a matched `buffer.channel_reads@1` read, joins the returned channel identity to the candidate channel and posted channel_id, binds service and organization scope to that candidate, and requires the read return before post dispatch. The adapter does not infer organization_id from the query argument when the returned record omits it."
